cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Giolit Trading Risk Verifier
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
abstract: Formal verification of trading strategies and risk controls. A proof
  that every rule holds on every run — any market move, fill, reject, cancel, and
  message order within assumptions, for any number of orders — or the event-by-event
  run as a FIX 4.4 log that breaks one. Signed proof certificates and risk headroom
  with the Giolit Risk Resilience Score.
